---
const arrow = "M3 7h8M7.5 3.5 11 7l-3.5 3.5";
---

<section
  aria-labelledby="hero-titulo"
  class="mx-auto grid min-h-[calc(100svh-4rem)] w-full max-w-site grid-cols-1 items-start gap-x-8 gap-y-14 px-6 pt-16 pb-16 md:px-10 md:pt-14 md:pb-16 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-center"
>
  <div class="min-w-0 lg:col-span-7 lg:self-center">
    <div>
      <p
        class="hero-rise font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.14em] text-muted uppercase"
        style="--delay: 0ms"
      >
        Desarrollador Full-Stack · Bogotá, Colombia
      </p>

      <h1
        id="hero-titulo"
        class="hero-rise mt-6 text-4xl leading-[1.08] font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] text-balance text-paper sm:text-5xl lg:text-[3.4rem]"
        style="--delay: 80ms"
      >
        Desarrollo full-stack con enfoque en <span class="text-accent">backend.</span>
      </h1>

      <p
        class="hero-rise mt-5 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted sm:text-base"
        style="--delay: 160ms"
      >
        Soy técnico en Programación de Software y estudiante de Tecnología en Análisis y Desarrollo de Software. Desarrollo aplicaciones web, APIs y soluciones orientadas a la gestión de datos y la lógica de negocio.
      </p>

      <p
        class="hero-rise mt-3 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted sm:text-base"
        style="--delay: 200ms"
      >
        Me interesa construir software bien estructurado, mantenible y preparado para resolver problemas reales.
      </p>

      <div
        class="hero-rise mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3"
        style="--delay: 260ms"
      >
        <a
          href="#proyectos"
          class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-sm bg-accent px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-ink transition-opacity duration-200 hover:opacity-90 motion-reduce:transition-none"
        >
          Ver proyectos
          <svg
            aria-hidden="true"
            viewBox="0 0 14 14"
            class="size-3.5 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 motion-reduce:transition-none"
          >
            <path
              d={arrow}
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.5"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            />
          </svg>
        </a>

        <a
          href="#contacto"
          class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-sm border border-line px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-paper transition-colors duration-200 hover:border-paper/40 motion-reduce:transition-none"
        >
          Hablemos
          <svg
            aria-hidden="true"
            viewBox="0 0 14 14"
            class="size-3.5 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 motion-reduce:transition-none"
          >
            <path
              d={arrow}
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.5"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>

      <p
        class="hero-rise mt-5 flex items-start gap-3 font-mono text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted"
        style="--delay: 320ms"
      >
        <span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1.5 size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-status"></span>
        Disponible para oportunidades laborales en desarrollo de software.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="hero-rise min-w-0 lg:col-span-5" style="--delay: 140ms">
    <div
      class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-md border border-line ring-1 ring-accent/20 aspect-[4/5]"
    >
      <img
        src="/images/portrait.jpg"
        alt="Retrato de Juan Manuel Rojas Rojas"
        width="1200"
        height="1442"
        decoding="async"
        class="h-full w-full object-cover"
      />

      <div
        class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 bg-linear-to-t from-ink/95 via-ink/50 to-transparent p-6 pt-24 md:p-8"
      >
        <p class="font-mono text-sm tracking-[0.06em] text-paper">Juan Manuel Rojas Rojas</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
